## Executive Summary

GPT-6-Sol is OpenAI's flagship general-purpose model from the GPT-6.1 family, released in 2026, designed for complex reasoning, coding, and knowledge work. It features a massive 1M token context window, competitive pricing, and strong performance across agentic benchmarks. The model ranks 42nd overall with a score of 88.3/100, indicating strong performance in the frontier model landscape. GPT-6-Sol is part of the GPT-6.1 family alongside GPT-6.1 Terra and GPT-6.1 Luna, offering different capabilities and pricing tiers.

